  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women- Advancing the Women, Peace and Security in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palestinian Women Lead the Way: strengthening a localized and gender responsive approach to peacemaking, humanitarian response and recovery in the aftermath of October 2023. The program aims at contributing to the implementation of Women, Peace and Security (WPS) commitments through  promoting the role and leadership of Palestinian women and women-led organizations in humanitarian assistance, relief and recovery and peace-making efforts at all levels, following the October 2023 War. The programme is aligned to the WPS commitments as articulated in Palestine National Action Plan (NAP).</narrative>
  </description>
